      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EXACERBATE (2) has her first outing without a trial but profiles nicely for this. Likely to go close here first time out. LOLLIPOP KIRRA (6) had second look this course and distance latest and improved on her time, finishing a 2 length second in 23.50. Strong run and expected to feature again. HOT TO TRACE (1) is yet to break through in 10 starts but has run a number of placings. Was in the placings again last time finishing third (30.43) at this track. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Can feature again. NABIAC CITY (8) returns after a break and looks a top-three hope.",
